{"persona": {"her": "方雨橙，超市理货组长、社区团购团长、算账快嘴更快，底线：群款一笔一清、不发吓唬人的营销话", "me": "郝行野，开修车铺、面包车能拉货、答应的事记得牢", "relationship_stage": "普通朋友偏熟（同小区，团购熟人一年）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "郝行野开修车铺，面包车能拉货，住方雨橙隔壁小区，帮她的社区团购拉过两回货；他自己在脐橙团里订两箱。", "her": "方雨橙是超市理货组长，业余做社区团购团长，11月16日周一起开赣南脐橙团：十斤装39.9一箱，11月17日周二晚八点截单，货到桥头仓由小蒲过磅，司机老驰送货，之后自提。", "warmth": "团购群里认识一年，他帮她拉货分拣不收钱，她每回塞他两斤水果，熟络爱损对方。", "style": "她叫他郝老板，说话快，爱用数目字，骂人带笑；他嘴硬，答应的事记得牢。", "lessons": "她报数要当场核，口径改了她一定声明；群里发的东西先给她过目，别替她拍板。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "开团第三天，橙子团三十七箱了。你的单我记在接龙里：郝行野，2箱，79.8。明晚八点截单，你核一下数，错了今晚喊我改。", "ts": "2026-11-16 20:22"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "群里有人嫌接龙口径乱，一会儿问运费一会儿问坏果。规则我重写了一版，你帮我顺顺：39.9一箱，十斤装，坏果包赔，今晚八点截单——就这几条事实，一个数不许错。别加什么手慢无、最后一天，咱群不吃这套。", "ts": "2026-11-17 13:03"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "截单了！", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:27"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "四十四箱。下午又进来八单，吴藕撤了两箱，三十八加八减二，四十四，我给小蒲报数改成四十四。你也记一下，明后天有人问就是这个数，别按旧的三十八说。", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:31"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "明早六点半货车到桥头仓。你帮我给小蒲带句话：让他把地磅那边留出来，四十四箱直接过磅再装车，省得二次搬。他电话你有的，前两回你们打过交道。", "ts": "2026-11-18 09:08"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "小蒲刚来电话：地磅明早要年检，过磅挪到明天下午两点，老驰的货车三点前必须到，不然赶不上周六自提。能赶，就是紧。你下午来不来？不来我一个人也能弄，就是慢。", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:43"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "四十四箱全过磅装完了，一箱没差！老驰两点五十到的，压着点，他骂骂咧咧说下回让小蒲把年检挪到别的礼拜。剩四十二箱进储物间，你那两箱你要是没空来拿，我放储物间给你留着，周六周日自提的人来之前你随时取。", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:32"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "今天自提走了三十五箱，还剩七箱。好评来了，有人写甜到怀疑人生，我截图存了，下回开团当广告使。你那两箱记得拿，别放着放到过年。", "ts": "2026-11-20 18:18"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "还剩一箱，三楼那位约的今天上午十点来拿，等到十点半人没影，消息不回。这单我要不要挂二手群原价出？眼看快十二月，橙子再放要放坏了。……算了，你别替我做主，我就想有人听我骂两句，骂完我自己处理。", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:33"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "人来了！九点来的，拎了袋自家晒的鱼干赔罪，说手机掉洗衣机里了，刚捞出来还在米缸里救。行吧。这周账清了：四十四箱，三十九块九一箱，一千七百五十五块六，一分不差。你的两箱七十九块八在里面，我本子上你名字后头画了个笑脸。", "ts": "2026-11-21 21:58"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "鱼干分了你一半，挂你家门把上了。麻薯团周三开，三箱九十九一口价，不拆零。你要三箱还是给你留一小盒尝？今晚说一声，我好写接龙。", "ts": "2026-11-22 19:24"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "麻薯接龙我写好了，你要三箱还是尝盒，周三开团前定都行，不催。正事：橙子团这回你在接龙里帮着盯了数，以后每团这活儿都归你，工钱一次一杯奶茶，攒到你结婚，够办流水席。别拒绝，我已经在群里宣布了。", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:08"}, {"uid": 12, "role": "HER", "text": "麻薯文案改完第三版，睡前最后一遍，明早发。鱼干吃了没？没吃赶紧吃，再放就该潮了。睡了睡了，周三见。", "ts": "2026-11-24 21:33"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|开团第三天，橙子团三十七箱了。你的单我记在接龙里：郝行野，2箱，79.8。明晚八点截单，你核一下数，错了今晚喊我改。|2026-11-16 20:22": 0, "HER|群里有人嫌接龙口径乱，一会儿问运费一会儿问坏果。规则我重写了一版，你帮我顺顺：39.9一箱，十斤装，坏果包赔，今晚八点截单——就这几条事实，一个数不许错。别加什么手慢无、最后一天，咱群不吃这套。|2026-11-17 13:03": 1, "HER|截单了！|2026-11-17 21:27": 2, "HER|四十四箱。下午又进来八单，吴藕撤了两箱，三十八加八减二，四十四，我给小蒲报数改成四十四。你也记一下，明后天有人问就是这个数，别按旧的三十八说。|2026-11-17 21:31": 3, "HER|明早六点半货车到桥头仓。你帮我给小蒲带句话：让他把地磅那边留出来，四十四箱直接过磅再装车，省得二次搬。他电话你有的，前两回你们打过交道。|2026-11-18 09:08": 4, "HER|小蒲刚来电话：地磅明早要年检，过磅挪到明天下午两点，老驰的货车三点前必须到，不然赶不上周六自提。能赶，就是紧。你下午来不来？不来我一个人也能弄，就是慢。|2026-11-18 21:43": 5, "HER|四十四箱全过磅装完了，一箱没差！老驰两点五十到的，压着点，他骂骂咧咧说下回让小蒲把年检挪到别的礼拜。剩四十二箱进储物间，你那两箱你要是没空来拿，我放储物间给你留着，周六周日自提的人来之前你随时取。|2026-11-19 15:32": 6, "HER|今天自提走了三十五箱，还剩七箱。好评来了，有人写甜到怀疑人生，我截图存了，下回开团当广告使。你那两箱记得拿，别放着放到过年。|2026-11-20 18:18": 7, "HER|还剩一箱，三楼那位约的今天上午十点来拿，等到十点半人没影，消息不回。这单我要不要挂二手群原价出？眼看快十二月，橙子再放要放坏了。……算了，你别替我做主，我就想有人听我骂两句，骂完我自己处理。|2026-11-21 11:33": 8, "HER|人来了！九点来的，拎了袋自家晒的鱼干赔罪，说手机掉洗衣机里了，刚捞出来还在米缸里救。行吧。这周账清了：四十四箱，三十九块九一箱，一千七百五十五块六，一分不差。你的两箱七十九块八在里面，我本子上你名字后头画了个笑脸。|2026-11-21 21:58": 9, "HER|鱼干分了你一半，挂你家门把上了。麻薯团周三开，三箱九十九一口价，不拆零。你要三箱还是给你留一小盒尝？今晚说一声，我好写接龙。|2026-11-22 19:24": 10, "HER|麻薯接龙我写好了，你要三箱还是尝盒，周三开团前定都行，不催。正事：橙子团这回你在接龙里帮着盯了数，以后每团这活儿都归你，工钱一次一杯奶茶，攒到你结婚，够办流水席。别拒绝，我已经在群里宣布了。|2026-11-23 20:08": 11, "HER|麻薯文案改完第三版，睡前最后一遍，明早发。鱼干吃了没？没吃赶紧吃，再放就该潮了。睡了睡了，周三见。|2026-11-24 21:33": 12}, "uid_seq": 13, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-16 20:30", "status": "explicit", "text": "核对她在接龙里记的单：两箱79.8", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-17 13:10", "status": "explicit", "text": "重写接龙规则：事实不动，别加营销话术", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-17 21:35", "status": "explicit", "text": "更新仓库报数：三十八改四十四，吴藕两箱已撤", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-18 09:15", "status": "explicit", "text": "给小蒲带话：明早留地磅，四十四箱过磅直装", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-18 21:50", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-16 20:30", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-17 13:10", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-17 21:35", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m1", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 5, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-18 09:15", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-18 21:50", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-19 15:40", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观点", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-20 18:25", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-21 11:40", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-21 22:05", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-22 19:30", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-23 20:15", "signal_hint": "拒绝", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "反抛", "action_allowed": false, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-24 21:40", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "收线", "action": "收尾", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "郝行野开修车铺，面包车能拉货，住方雨橙隔壁小区，帮她的社区团购拉过两回货；他自己在脐橙团里订两箱。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "方雨橙是超市理货组长，业余做社区团购团长，11月16日周一起开赣南脐橙团：十斤装39.9一箱，11月17日周二晚八点截单，货到桥头仓由小蒲过磅，司机老驰送货，之后自提。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "团购群里认识一年，他帮她拉货分拣不收钱，她每回塞他两斤水果，熟络爱损对方。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "她叫他郝老板，说话快，爱用数目字，骂人带笑；他嘴硬，答应的事记得牢。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "郝行野，开修车铺、面包车能拉货、答应的事记得牢", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "方雨橙，超市理货组长、社区团购团长、算账快嘴更快，底线：群款一笔一清、不发吓唬人的营销话", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "脐橙团已开团三天，共三十七箱", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购进度", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["橙子团三十七箱了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-16", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 20:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 20:30", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "脐橙团明晚八点截单", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购时间", "evidence_uids": [0, 2], "evidence_quotes": ["明晚八点截单", "截单了！"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 20:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 20:30", "valid_to": "2026-11-17 21:35", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 20:30", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "脐橙团明晚八点截单", "valid_to": "2026-11-17 21:35", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "截单了！"}]}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "郝行野的单记为2箱，79.8元", "subject": "ME", "relation": "团购订单", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["郝行野，2箱，79.8"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 20:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 20:30", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "规则四条：39.9一箱，十斤装，坏果包赔，今晚八点截单", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购规则", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["39.9一箱，十斤装，坏果包赔，今晚八点截单"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 20:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 13:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 13:10", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "脐橙团截单，共四十四箱", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购数量", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["四十四箱。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 21:31", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:35", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "下午又进八单，吴藕撤两箱，三十八加八减二等于四十四", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购数量变动", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["三十八加八减二，四十四"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 下午至晚间", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:35", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "她已向小蒲报数改成四十四", "subject": "HER", "relation": "报数", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["我给小蒲报数改成四十四。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 21:31", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:35", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "她要求按四十四记，不再用旧的三十八", "subject": "HER", "relation": "口径", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["明后天有人问就是这个数，别按旧的三十八说。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 21:31", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:35", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "脐橙团已截单", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购进度", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["截单了！"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 21:27", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:35", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "过磅改到2026-11-19下午两点，老驰货车三点前必须到桥头仓", "subject": "HER", "relation": "脐橙团送货安排", "evidence_uids": [4, 5, 6], "evidence_quotes": ["明早六点半货车到桥头仓。", "过磅挪到明天下午两点", "四十四箱全过磅装完了，一箱没差！老驰两点五十到的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 06:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:50", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 15:40", "supersedes": "f_0016@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 09:15", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "明早六点半货车到桥头仓", "valid_to": "2026-11-18 21:50", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [5], "quote": "过磅挪到明天下午两点"}, {"status": "confirmed", "text": "过磅改到2026-11-19下午两点，老驰货车三点前必须到桥头仓", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 15:40", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "四十四箱全过磅装完了，一箱没差！老驰两点五十到的"}]}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "她让郝行野给小蒲带话，让小蒲留出地磅，四十四箱直接过磅再装车", "subject": "HER", "relation": "托付转达", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["你帮我给小蒲带句话：让他把地磅那边留出来，四十四箱直接过磅再装车，省得二次搬。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 06:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 09:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 09:15", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "地磅明早要年检，过磅挪到明天下午两点", "subject": "HER", "relation": "脐橙团装车安排", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["地磅明早要年检，过磅挪到明天下午两点"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 14:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:50", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:50", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "老驰的货车三点前必须到，不然赶不上周六自提", "subject": "HER", "relation": "脐橙团装车安排", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["老驰的货车三点前必须到，不然赶不上周六自提"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 15:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:50", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:50", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "四十四箱全过磅装完，一箱没差", "subject": "HER", "relation": "脐橙团装车结果", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["四十四箱全过磅装完了，一箱没差！"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 15:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:40", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "老驰两点五十到桥头仓", "subject": "HER", "relation": "送货", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["老驰两点五十到的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 14:50", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 15:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:40", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "剩四十二箱进储物间", "subject": "HER", "relation": "存货", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["剩四十二箱进储物间"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 15:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:40", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "郝行野那两箱放储物间留着，周六周日自提前随时取", "subject": "HER", "relation": "取货安排", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["你那两箱你要是没空来拿，我放储物间给你留着，周六周日自提的人来之前你随时取。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 至 周末", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 15:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:40", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "郝行野那两箱的具体取货时间未定，先放储物间留着", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["你那两箱你要是没空来拿，我放储物间给你留着"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 15:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:40", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "今天自提走了三十五箱，还剩七箱", "subject": "HER", "relation": "脐橙团自提进度", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["今天自提走了三十五箱，还剩七箱"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "她存了好评截图，打算下回开团当广告用", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购素材", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["我截图存了，下回开团当广告使"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "郝行野那两箱待取，具体时间仍未定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["你那两箱记得拿，别放着放到过年"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "橙子还剩一箱", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购余货", "evidence_uids": [8, 9], "evidence_quotes": ["还剩一箱", "人来了！九点来的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-21", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 11:40", "valid_to": "2026-11-21 22:05", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:40", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "橙子还剩一箱", "valid_to": "2026-11-21 22:05", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "人来了！九点来的"}]}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "三楼那位约今天上午十点来拿，等到十点半没来、消息不回", "subject": "HER", "relation": "自提放鸽子", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["三楼那位约的今天上午十点来拿，等到十点半人没影，消息不回"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 11:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:40", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "最后一箱要不要挂二手群原价出，未定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["这单我要不要挂二手群原价出？"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 11:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:40", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "三楼那位九点来取货，拎了袋自家晒的鱼干赔罪，说手机掉洗衣机里了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "取货", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["人来了！九点来的，拎了袋自家晒的鱼干赔罪，说手机掉洗衣机里了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 晚九点", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 22:05", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 22:05", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "这周账清了：四十四箱，每箱三十九块九，共一千七百五十五块六，一分不差", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购结算", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["这周账清了：四十四箱，三十九块九一箱，一千七百五十五块六，一分不差"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 22:05", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 22:05", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "郝行野的两箱共七十九块八已含在账内，她本子上他名字后头画了个笑脸", "subject": "HER", "relation": "账目", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["你的两箱七十九块八在里面，我本子上你名字后头画了个笑脸"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 22:05", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 22:05", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "方雨橙把鱼干分了一半，挂在郝行野家门把上", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邻居/团购熟人", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["鱼干分了你一半，挂你家门把上了。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-22 19:24", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 19:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 19:30", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "麻薯团周三开，三箱九十九一口价，不拆零", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["麻薯团周三开，三箱九十九一口价，不拆零。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "周三", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 19:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 19:30", "history": []}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "方雨橙说以后每团盯数的活儿都归郝行野，工钱一次一杯奶茶", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购分工", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["以后每团这活儿都归你，工钱一次一杯奶茶"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:15", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "麻薯要三箱还是尝盒，周三开团前定都行", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["你要三箱还是尝盒，周三开团前定都行，不催"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:15", "history": []}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "麻薯文案改完第三版，明早发", "subject": "HER", "relation": "团购文案", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["麻薯文案改完第三版，睡前最后一遍，明早发。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-25 早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-24 21:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-24 21:40", "history": []}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "周三见", "subject": "HER", "relation": "约定", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["周三见。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-25", "valid_from": "2026-11-24 21:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-24 21:40", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 39, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0008", "action": "complete", "text": "脐橙团明晚八点截单", "old_text": "脐橙团明晚八点截单", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:35", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "截单了！"}, {"fact_id": "f_0016", "action": "correct", "text": "过磅改到2026-11-19下午两点，老驰货车三点前必须到桥头仓", "old_text": "明早六点半货车到桥头仓", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:50", "src_uids": [5], "quote": "过磅挪到明天下午两点"}, {"fact_id": "f_0016", "action": "complete", "text": "过磅改到2026-11-19下午两点，老驰货车三点前必须到桥头仓", "old_text": "过磅改到2026-11-19下午两点，老驰货车三点前必须到桥头仓", "ts": "2026-11-19 15:40", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "四十四箱全过磅装完了，一箱没差！老驰两点五十到的"}, {"fact_id": "f_0028", "action": "complete", "text": "橙子还剩一箱", "old_text": "橙子还剩一箱", "ts": "2026-11-21 22:05", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "人来了！九点来的"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}